ram-sender stubs; corrupting-cp + vfat-chmod override stubs; per-test lsblk JSON fixtures).\n- Working tree clean except untracked `dream.md` (deliberately left; user offered options — fold into AGENT_TODO Later/README or leave).\n- Automount research done: read `features/autostart.sh`, `templates/feature.sh`, `systemd/autostart.service`, `install.sh` (150–169), `postinstall.sh` (134–156), `DOC/SYSTEMD.md`; grepped autostart mentions across repo; confirmed no existing USB-storage automount/udev code.\n\n### Active\n- Automount feature: **design not yet presented/approved; nothing implemented.** Open design points: exact trigger mechanism (udev rule written by postinstall vs. polling systemd unit vs. udev→systemd handoff), mount method (`udisksctl` vs `mount`/sudo), whether to auto-unmount, feature flag name, and udev-rule install location (`/etc/udev/rules.d/`, flag-gated in postinstall.sh).\n\n### Blocked\n- (none) — awaiting design confirmation; udev/mount specifics undecided.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Present the automount design mirroring autostart: `features/usb-automount.sh` + `systemd/<name>.service` with `postinstall.sh` `flag_is_set` gate + udev rule for plug-in triggering; confirm naming (`usb-automount`) and mode (mount plugged-in removable storage; reuse `lsblk -J`/jq detection).\n2. On approval: implement per `templates/feature.sh`; build stub harness `/tmp/opencode/usb-automount-test` (HOME-isolated, stub udevadm/systemctl/mount, seams); update docs (AGENT_Context §2/§13 filetable + features rows are hand-maintained above the GEN marker, SYSTEMD.md Services + Feature-flag gating, README/SCRIPTS/POS autostart-adjacent lists, DEV.md env seams if any); `make gen && make check`; add AGENT_TODO entry; commit.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `features/autostart.sh`, `templates/feature.sh`, `systemd/autostart.service`, `install.sh` (150–169), `postinstall.sh` (134–156), `DOC/SYSTEMD.md`: the feature/flag/systemd pattern to mirror exactly.\n- `bin/pos-system-backup` (220 lines, committed): the USB-copy feature this automount feature complements; `BACKUP_USB_ROOT` seam, lsblk+jq detection contract.\n- `/tmp/opencode/{sched-test,smb-test,backup-test}/`: green stub-suite harnesses (92/16/40) — model for the new automount suite.\n- `DOC/AGENT_Context_Project.md` (§2 directory, §13 file table with hand-maintained `features/*` line-count rows above the GEN:START filetable marker), `DOC/POS.md`, `DOC/README.md`, `DOC/SCRIPTS.md`, `DOC/DEV.md`: docs to update for the new feature (run `make gen` after).\n- `AGENT_TODO.md`: add automount item now, move to Done in the feature commit.\n- `dream.md`: remains untracked (user decision pending).",
