eterministic); gum path smoke via `POS_GUM` stub + `script -qec` PTY driving (DEV.md line 196 technique). Assert side effects (env writes), not keystrokes.\n9. **Carve-out**: entertainment plugins never use ui.sh (stdout = Telegram message).\n\n## Progress\n- ✅ Step 1 — `lib/ui.sh` done; `bash -n` OK; plain-mode primitives smoke-tested (choose/input/multiselect/confirm/validate_num/abort all correct).\n- ✅ Step 2 — `lib/config-ui.sh` typed rewrite done; `cfg_ui` via ui.sh; verified live: `pos config telegram` full menu→edit→write→keep cycle under `POS_UI=plain` (note: sanitize PATH — stale `/usr/local/bin` install shadows repo tools via `command -v` dispatch; harnesses must use `./bin/pos` + PATH minus /usr/local/bin).\n- ✅ Step 3 — wizard done; verified under `script -qec` PTY: `ENABLED = gold, 1h — schedule synced`. Tip: PTY input is consumed 1 line per prompt (echo appears at top — cosmetic); align piped lines exactly (3 toggles + interval, then key prompts only for ENABLED plugins).\n- ✅ Step 4 — `bin/pos-menu` done (chmod +x, bash -n OK); `menu` added to `INTERACTIVE_CMDS`.\n- ✅ Step 5 — `preinstall.sh` `_install_gum` + install.sh ui.sh line done.\n- ✅ Step 6 — retrofit batch done (network-scan bare prompt, media-mp3/mp4 URL prompt, docker-compose `_compose_interactive` pre-definition before `[ $# -eq 0 ] && usage`, smb-client `_smb_interactive` moved **before** the validating case — call site must come after definition); `INTERACTIVE_CMDS` gained `media-mp3 docker-compose network-scan`. All `bash -n` green.\n- ⏳ Step 7 — docs (DEV.md convention + checklist, POS.md, SCRIPTS.md, AGENT_Context), harnesses (ui-test, menu-test, wizard), AGENT_TODO Done dated, `make gen && make check`, commit.\n- Note: `make check` dispatch smoke (check-sync.sh:33-35) runs plain `bash bin/pos …` — on this box it also resolves stale `/usr/local/bin` copies; run it with sanitized PATH if it fails.\n\n## Steps\n- **Step 0** — DEV.md `## Interactive UI Convention` section (before Best Practices); \"Make it interactive\" step in Adding-a-Tool checklist (after §1 create script, before §6 docs); pointer in plugin checklist; AGENT_Context \"How to modify\" row.\n- **Step 1** — `lib/ui.sh` (new): implements convention (helpers, seams, dispatch). Gum install mirror: `preinstall.sh:61` yt-dlp curl pattern + arch detect + tar.gz extract (gum not in Debian repos); chmod a+rx to `/usr/local/bin/gum`.\n- **Step 2** — `lib/config-ui.sh` upgrade: typed flags `bool`/`list`/`enum(a,b,c)` alongside `secret|digits|num|float`; `cfg_ui` renders via ui.sh; Enter-keeps/`-`-clears preserved; non-TTY = current numbered flow. Parser refs: `_cfg_key_line` (~92), `_cfg_plugin_keys` (~116), `cfg_scope_keys` (~140) split on `|` → enum options use commas.\n- **Step 3** — `bin/pos-entertainment-config` wizard: bare-on-TTY = guided editor; ENABLED = multiselect of installed plugins + interval picker → CSV assembled for user; WEATHER_LAT/LON validated w/ defaults; interactive undeclared-key keep/edit/remove; `set`/`--show`/non-TTY unchanged.\n- **Step 4** — `bin/pos-menu` (new, category-less like pos-config/pos-tree, `# POS:` header, add to `INTERACTIVE_CMDS`): category → tool → run guided / run bare / help / back; guided prompts per `# POS_FLAGS:` (`--no-*`/bare = ui_confirm, rest = ui_input); `--dry-run` prints assembled command (test seam).\n- **Step 5** — retrofit seed batch: `network scan` (CIDR), `media mp3/mp4` (URL), `docker compose` (action/service), `share smb client mount` (share).\n- **Step 6** — migrate one existing editor to ui.sh as proof: **config-ui's own cfg_ui** (lean; it's the shared foundation the wizard sits on).\n- **Step 7** — tests + docs: `/tmp/opencode/ui-test` (per-type plain mode + POS_GUM stub smoke + script PTY), `menu-test` (dry-run assembly), wizard fixtures (fake plugin dir with `# POS_KEYS:` markers); POS.md (menu + config rows), SCRIPTS.md (ui.sh), DEV.md (convention), AGENT_Context (tree/filetable/rows), AGENT_TODO Done dated; `make gen && make check` (pre-commit hook runs it).\n\n## Decisions (user-approved / stated)\n- gum = \"modern UI\" engine, **auto-installed** in preinstall (like yt-dlp).\n- Pure-bash fallback mandatory; old text flow reachable via plain mode / non-TTY.\n- Core = Steps 1–3; Step 4 = broad \"everything interactive\" umbrella; Step 5 seeds convention.\n- Open point: Step 6 migration target → config-ui (my lean).\n\n## Verification\n`make gen && make check` (bash -n + exec-bit + doc-sync + dispatch smoke). Harnesses: ui-test, menu-test, wizard test — all green. Conventional commit (`feat:`). Nothing pushed unless asked.\n\n## Key files\n`lib/ui.sh` (new), `lib/config-ui.sh`, `bin/pos-entertainment-config`, `bin/pos-menu` (new), `bin/pos` (INTERACTIVE_CMDS), `preinstall.sh` (gum install), `bin/pos-{network-scan,media-mp3,media-mp4,docker-compose,share-smb-client}`, `lib/common.sh` (confirm at ~116), `DOC/{DEV,POS,SCRIPTS,AGENT_Context_Project}.md`, `AGENT_TODO.md`, `/tmp/opencode/` harnesses.",
